# Allowlist: the Docker build context contains only what the Dockerfile
# COPYs. Everything else (docs, media, tools, workflows, personal files,
# build output, git metadata) stays on the host. Keep this in step with the
# COPY lines in the Dockerfile.
*
!CMakeLists.txt
!VERSION
!vlights.ini
!cmake/
!src/
!res/
!tests/
!third_party/

# never, even inside the allowed folders
**/*.log
**/*.png
**/*.jpg
**/*.gif
**/*.mp4
**/__pycache__/
